@startuml
title IntelliSolve - Sequence Diagram (Solve Drawing)
actor User
participant "React Home / Canvas" as UI
participant Axios
participant "FastAPI /calculate" as API
participant Pillow
participant "Gemini Generative AI" as Gemini
User -> UI : Draw problem and click Run
UI -> UI : canvas.toDataURL("image/png")
UI -> Axios : POST image + dict_of_vars
Axios -> API : HTTP POST /calculate
API -> API : Validate ImageData request
API -> API : Split data URL and Base64 decode
API -> Pillow : Image.open(BytesIO(image_bytes))
Pillow --> API : Image object
API -> Gemini : Prompt + image + assigned variables
Gemini --> API : Generated structured text
API -> API : ast.literal_eval(response.text)
API -> API : Set assign flag on each answer
API --> Axios : {message, data, status}
Axios --> UI : Response data
UI -> UI : Set expression / answer state
UI -> UI : Render MathJax answer overlay
UI --> User : Display answer on canvas
@enduml